warning[SCXML079]: `cond` on `<transition>` is not an `In('stateID')` predicate, the only condition the null data model supports
 --> tests/ui/scxml079-null-expressions.scxml:3:28
  |
1 | <scxml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml" version="1.0" datamodel="null" initial="s">
  |                                                                         ---- the null data model is selected here
2 |   <state id="s">
3 |     <transition event="go" cond="x &gt; 1" target="f"/>
  |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `cond` requires a data model
  |
  = note: the null data model has no data, value expressions, location expressions, or scripts; conditions may only be `In('stateID')`, with the state ID quoted
  = help: rewrite the condition as `In('stateID')`, or select a data model that supports it, such as `datamodel="ecmascript"`
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model
help: select the ECMAScript data model
